 "allGatesLocally": "82 of 82 passed on the final preparation (11 Nov). First pass under three parallel gates: 78 green, 4 red. Taught: hogwarts-dma-copies (later-adapter table), gc-events and gc-fallback (the final journal is the control's plus the Core 725 start-of-process addition, compiled on the candidate side; gc-fallback's rebuilt control keeps the earlier journal). compute-switch-bindings was load-dependent and green alone. pipeline-variant-replay expects the 600 planned states once adapt_variant_replay_all is later in the chain. Nine receipts older than the shared helper's last edit and the two gates reading the MoltenVK patch were run again; every receipt's inputs match the frozen tree.",
